---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Product | Sheriff"
  description="Sheriff is a declarative way to manage Azure Privileged Identity Management through code, pull requests and pipelines."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-300">Product</p>

    <h1
      class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-7xl"
    >
      Declarative governance for Azure privileged access.
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
      Sheriff lets teams define Azure PIM configuration in code, review access
      changes through pull requests and deploy approved state through pipelines.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-300">Managed resources</p>

        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
          Bring privileged access under source control.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
          Manage the Azure PIM configuration that controls who can elevate, when
          they can activate and under what conditions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          Role eligibility schedules
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          Active assignments
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          Approval settings
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          Activation duration
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          PIM groups
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          Azure AD groups
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          Subscription scopes
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
          Management group scopes
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-300">Pipeline first</p>

        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
          Designed for controlled change.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
          Instead of changing PIM manually in the portal, teams can propose,
          review and deploy changes using the same controls they already use for
          infrastructure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-400/20 bg-black/30 p-6"
      >
        <pre
          class="overflow-x-auto text-sm leading-7 text-emerald-300"><code>name: Deploy Azure PIM configuration

on:
  pull_request:
  push:
    branches:
      - main

steps:
  - name: Validate Sheriff configuration
    run: sheriff validate ./pim

  - name: Apply approved PIM state
    run: sheriff apply ./pim</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA />
</Layout>
